<creative id="EI26-COLD-44-v6-diario" status="ready" priority="P0" version="winner-pattern-v6-costanza-40plus">
  <meta>
    <campaign>Estate Inarrestabile 2026</campaign>
    <objective>LEADS</objective>
    <funnel-stage>cold</funnel-stage>
    <angle>Il Diario Alimentare Interrotto - pagina 4 e basta</angle>
    <pain-targeted>Diario alimentare iniziato con entusiasmo + abbandonato dopo 4 giorni</pain-targeted>
    <copy-framework>Pain-Direct + Object Specifity</copy-framework>
    <design-template>v6-brand-pain-costanza</design-template>
  </meta>

  <image-generation>
    <model>gpt-image-2 (via Higgsfield)</model>
    <reference-images>
      <ref id="elena-higgsfield" required="true">Reference Elena caricate in Higgsfield</ref>
    </reference-images>
    <prompt-elaborate language="en">
      <![CDATA[
A 45-year-old Italian woman (use Elena Higgsfield reference) holding a small notebook open showing handwritten pages on the first few pages then blank pages clearly visible (the contrast between filled and empty pages should be visible). Her expression: direct knowing slight smile, "we both started one of these" coach energy.

She wears practical home clothes. Clean modern home, soft daylight.

CRITICAL STYLE: PRACTICAL coach moment, NOT cinematic. Real Italian woman 45. Notebook handwritten pages but text not specifically readable.

Composition: Elena chest up center frame, notebook visible held open in hands, plenty of negative space top/bottom for brand overlay.
      ]]>
    </prompt-elaborate>
    <negative-prompt>cinematic editorial, dramatic, sad, golden hour, model thin, instagram filter, makeup heavy, vintage notebook luxury</negative-prompt>
    <output-specs><aspect-ratio>1:1</aspect-ratio><resolution>1080x1080</resolution><variations-to-generate>4</variations-to-generate></output-specs>
  </image-generation>

  <design-brief output="canva-figma-static">
    <canvas><aspect-ratio>1:1</aspect-ratio><resolution>1080x1080</resolution><bg-base>foto-elena</bg-base></canvas>
    <brand-tokens>
      <color name="brand-pink" hex="#FF0066"/>
      <color name="brand-black" hex="#000000"/>
      <color name="brand-white" hex="#FFFFFF"/>
    </brand-tokens>
    <layout-zones>
      <zone id="top-banner" position="top" height-pct="18" bg="brand-pink" z-index="2">
        <text language="it">WEBINAR PER DONNE 40+</text>
        <font>Inter Black ALL-CAPS</font><font-color>brand-white</font-color>
        <font-size-pct>8</font-size-pct><align>center</align>
      </zone>
      <zone id="photo-area" position="middle" height-pct="64" z-index="1">
        <photo>foto Elena (full width, cover)</photo>
        <gradient-overlay-bottom>linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.65) 0%, transparent 50%)</gradient-overlay-bottom>
      </zone>
      <zone id="headline-overlay" position="lower-middle-on-photo" margin-bottom="32px" padding="0 32px" z-index="3">
        <text-block alignment="center" line-spacing="1.3">
          <line emoji="📓">Il diario alimentare:</line>
          <line><bold>Pagina 1, 2, 3, 4.</bold></line>
          <line><highlight bg="brand-pink" color="brand-white" padding="2px 8px">Bianco</highlight> da li in poi.</line>
        </text-block>
        <font>Inter Black</font>
        <font-color>brand-white</font-color>
        <text-shadow>0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)</text-shadow>
        <font-size-pct>5.5</font-size-pct>
      </zone>
      <zone id="scarcity-pill" position="bottom-right" margin-bottom="120px" margin-right="24px" z-index="3">
        <shape>pill rounded</shape><bg>brand-pink</bg><padding>6px 16px</padding>
        <text language="it">100 Posti</text>
        <font>Inter Bold</font><font-color>brand-white</font-color><font-size-pct>3.5</font-size-pct>
      </zone>
      <zone id="footer" position="bottom" height-pct="18" layout="split-50-50" z-index="2">
        <half side="left" bg="brand-pink">
          <text-line-1 language="it">Lunedi, 19</text-line-1>
          <text-line-2 language="it">MAGGIO 18.30</text-line-2>
          <font>Inter Black ALL-CAPS</font><font-color>brand-white</font-color>
          <font-size-pct>5.8</font-size-pct><align>center</align>
        </half>
        <half side="right" bg="brand-white">
          <text language="it">ISCRIVITI GRATIS</text>
          <font>Inter Black ALL-CAPS</font><font-color>brand-black</font-color>
          <font-size-pct>5.5</font-size-pct><align>center</align>
        </half>
      </zone>
    </layout-zones>
  </design-brief>

  <copy-for-meta-ads-manager>
    <primary-text language="it">
      <![CDATA[
📓 Il diario alimentare. Pagina 1, 2, 3, 4. Bianco da li in poi.

E il bullet journal? E l'app per tracciare le calorie? E il Notion che ti sei fatta?

